<Essay title="Board AI Oversight: Go Slow to Go Fast | Jack P. Flaherty"
  description="Deferring a technology decision is the most expensive option a board has. Jack P. Flaherty, former Big 4 director, on the four questions an audit chair asks once to say yes faster."
